From: Fix <dev@local>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:21:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Simplify navigation: 14 sidebar items -> 7 areas with
 tabs; quick actions on a prospect

- Home, Find prospects, Prospects (list/map/qualify + pipeline board), Email & outreach (Gmail inbox / Write from template / Follow-ups),
  Calendar & tasks, Insights, Settings. Each area remembers its last tab.
- Prospect quick actions: Write email (template composer with the prospect chosen), Schedule follow-up (pre-filled task, user saves), Show on map
- Docs + acceptance checklist updated
