Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Remove redundant code and screens; make the live finder
 use the shared duplicate check and fit score; fix Export and a
 duplicate-detection bug

- Remove ~1,240 unreachable lines from App.jsx (old finder modal + its search helpers, Leaflet pin setup) and 7 unused one-line helpers
- Admin: replace the second Prospects table with a pointer to the Prospects area (also removes the 'Reset all CRM data' button that overwrote prospects with sample data)
- Activity log: remove the duplicate email composer (Outreach desk does it); add 'Write an email' hand-off
- Finder: fuzzy 'already in CRM / possible match', cross-source merge, Fit column, priority + why-fit on add, HR-title detection
- Fix: Export to Excel threw on every click (missing '>' in an arrow function); row builder moved to a tested module
- Fix: duplicate detector treated listing links (ProPublica/OpenStreetMap/...) as the organisation's website, chaining unrelated charities together
- Tests: 175 logic tests; 14 cleanup checks; whole-codebase no-undef check clean
