- Client: all categories + name hints + keyword sent; industry carried onto results for scoring; no industry/name -> asks instead of searching restaurants;
  best-first ordering; address + distance + Street View/Find on Maps per result; List / Map + Street View switch
- Street View via Google's documented keyless links (no API key); nonprofits only offered 'Find on Maps'
- Migration 8: latitude/longitude/street_address (pair-or-nothing constraint, tested on a real Postgres engine); app stores them when present
- Territory map: exact pins and links; prospect side panel: Street View / Open in Maps
- Tests: 195 logic tests; 22 end-to-end finder checks; 10 migration checks
