- Moves go through applyStatus; moving into a 'sent' stage asks first and lists what will change; Undo for 12s; refused saves are reported
- 'Move to...' menu on each card (keyboard, touch, screen reader) alongside drag and drop
- Do Not Respond hidden by default and never movable into outreach; view-only accounts cannot move cards
- Cards: fit score, next step / overdue, reply, last touch, Email (opens Outreach desk), Street View; columns: counts, overdue, replies, avg fit; filters + Needs action
- Theme tokens instead of fixed colours; removed the duplicate sticky filter bar and ~230 lines of old board code
- Tests: 205 logic tests (10 new rules tests); 26 end-to-end board checks
